 you ever wanted to be a circle? Well, your dream has come true in Circle Game! In this cartoonish and fun game, there are very silly and non-serious places you can visit. Such as: a forest, a beach, a very cool credit room, a hamster cage, and a mysterious cave...\n\nAs circle game 1 comes to an end.. we've created a gallery to show all update art, funny moments, and trailers for previous updates!\n\nJoin the discord for development updates and stupid fun overall!: \nhttps://discord.gg/VNs8KsDS4W\n", "short_description": "This silly little game has you as a circle, you move around by using your weirdly shaped hands. Explore this weird universe inhabited with tons of easter eggs and other fun stuff!"}]}, "developer_name": "SwitcherBeats", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/fb34a9fc-2d07-4641-85d4-547f0c68f591", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SwitcherBeats", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/circle-game-site/home", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "6678585642239004"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982614_1526942004795027_1778079622792995769_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i_a60vpzNlsQ7kNvwFzB8lI&_nc_oc=AdrkaowjBuLrMuh9rmEjufVEN0cmdJdnh2